  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>For the duration, moonlight fills a 20-foot Emanation originating from you with Dim Light. While in that area, you and your allies have &amp;Reference[halfcover apply=false]{Half Cover} and Resistance to Cold, Lightning, and Radiant damage.</p><p>While the spell lasts, you can use one of the following options, which ends the spell immediately.</p><p><strong>Liberation.</strong> When you fail a saving throw to avoid or end the &amp;Reference[frightened apply=false]{Frightened}, &amp;Reference[grappled apply=false]{Grappled}, or &amp;Reference[restrained apply=false]{Restrained} condition, you can take a Reaction to succeed on the save instead.</p><p><strong>Respite.</strong> As a Magic action, you or an ally in the area regains Hit Points equal to 4d10 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-TSLIpaiCDcthQ6SP\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Apply the effect (Half Cover and the Resistances) to the allies in the area. Using Liberation or Respite ends the spell.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
